34892::$$$message_0263_0099_0000$$$::「んっ、[wait canskip=0 time=400]お仕置きです、[wait canskip=0 time=200][shock vmax=15 time=400 count-=2][fadein time=300 storage=fdh10b_桜ライダー04d2 textoff=0]ぁはぁ[line len=3]っ！」::
